+ *  - ONE process-wide "player loop" thread owns SDL (SDL_Init/SDL_Quit), every
+ *    window, renderer and texture, pumps the SDL event queue and runs
+ *    video_refresh() for every instance.  SDL's event queue is process global,
+ *    so events are routed to the instance by window id.
